<%# The picker's legal-age attestation, as the solana-studio picker's SLOT.
    Guests only: a wallet connect is create-or-login, so a brand-new wallet
    creates an account, while a linking flow or a signed-in user has already
    answered. needsAttestation is contributed by extra_data
    (WalletPickerHelper), and the slot renders INSIDE the picker's root, so it
    binds straight to it.

    The AppFlags gate is at the callsite in WalletPickerHelper, not here: the
    engine checkbox does not self-gate, so a parked flag means no slot at all.

    ONE ROOT inside the template, per Alpine. %>
<template x-if="needsAttestation">
  <div class="mb-3">
    <%= render "studio/modals/shared/age_attestation" %>
  </div>
</template>
